sequenceDiagram
    participant Event as Event Dispatched
    participant Check as shouldBroadcast Check
    participant Queue as Redis Queue
    participant Worker as Queue Worker
    participant Provider as Reverb/Pusher
    participant Frontend as Echo Frontend
    
    Event->>Check: NotificationCreated.php
    Check->>Queue: Store job
    Queue->>Worker: Process job
    Worker->>Provider: Send to channel
    Provider->>Frontend: Receive & update UI
    Note over Frontend: No page reload
